advanced.description:
{Advanced Summon Trolls}

Summons Trolls to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Trolls summoned is 50% greater than Basic Summon Trolls.

expert.description:
{Expert Summon Trolls}

Summons Trolls to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Trolls summoned is 100% greater than Basic Summon Trolls.
